  id: marksoftheoldways
  displayName: Marks of the Old Ways
  description: 'The last of what Ingrid''s grandmother taught her: a mark cut into gear at the altar holds a blessing as long as the gear holds together. She knows a few of the safe ones, and so do you, once you look.'
  chain: Ingrid
  journalNotes: 'At the altar choose Enchant: each piece of gear takes one mark. The ones you know are listed; the rest are found in the woods as inscriptions (Liv reads them, if she''s home). Purified marks are safe; cursed ones are stronger and always take a price.'
